      "id": "find_fcffc5c21d444a6a",
      "workspace_id": "ws_d046141f7f7d4391",
      "summary": "Inferred root cause: r184's undersized DB pool causes checkout timeouts returning 503",
      "detail": "The r184 revision sets DB_POOL_MAX=4 per pod. With 2 pods carrying ~25% of checkout traffic, each pool is exhausted; requests queue (pending ~40) and wait hits the 3000ms checkout timeout, surfacing as 503. Consistent with (a) onset when r184 began taking traffic at 09:15, (b) ~40% error rate only on r184, (c) r183 unaffected, (d) healthy database with idle connections. This is an inference from correlation across the four evidence files, not a direct code-level proof.",
      "confidence": 0.85,
